Z||000000||grinthock||07-14-2001||07:02 PM||||Ever since I got my 87GT the drivers door RATTLES when I hit a bump, and it is driving me nuts, anyone have any ideas?  Sounds like the hinges or something.... Any ideas?||||reg||8
